198152924706", "personaname": "SafeSpaceDestroyer", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/joehardesty422/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 80, "playtime_forever": 32281, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 32161, "last_played": 1665807470, "avatar": "eb51ab7b7f725dbd3adcc42dde3fbb84c12a91a7"}, "language": "english", "review": "Warframe is one of those hardcore timesinks, a game that provide an insane amount of content to the playerbase and is so overwhelming that it takes a couple dozen hours to just get an idea of what it is you want to really do. \n\n\nThere are many things here for many different types of gamers, from open world exploration, collecting, grinding, skins, weapons, dozens of Warframes with unique abilities, really great stories and interesting missions, space combat, underwater combat, a helpful inclusive community full of veterans willing to lend a hand, to a deep customization component for all of your items and ship. There are nearly 200 achievements here for us hunters, and many different biomes and enemy types across a plethora of planets. \n\nI'm not interested in crapping on the parts of the game I don't like, I've been provided with endless entertainment and would certainly recommend this to players who are looking to invest time and energy into something new. \n", "timestamp_created": 1613943933, "timestamp_updated": 1665777937, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "87189846", "author": {"steamid": "76561199142795497", "personaname": "Fuego", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199142795497/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 3216, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 791, "last_played": 1615516167, "avatar": "82b1bcae2bdc3ac16cd1613afef1698361d735bb"}, "language": "english", "review": "its awesome, the best free game anyone could play. they could charge $60 for the game it i would buy it 3x over.\n", "timestamp_created": 1613943766, "timestamp_updated": 1613943766, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "87189655", "author": {"steamid": "76561198062288188", "personaname": "ᵉᵍᵍ", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/cbk_nexus/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 48288, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5179, "last_played": 1782089726, "avatar": "324c8e5e465476b30c10c74f9870d40e67494b6d"}, "language": "english", "review": "F2P, but takes actual work to be F2P. Feels rewarding when you get stuff cause you know you put int he work, can speed up almost everything by using money but where is the fun in that", "timestamp_created": 1613943513, "timestamp_updated": 1613943513, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.52173912525177002", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}]}